        <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;tim--tim1_inputcapture&#34;&gt;TIM — TIM1_InputCapture
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;固件库&lt;/strong&gt;: PY32L020_Firmware V1.2.1&lt;br&gt;
